  m_text: "The borders of our glorious Empire are beset by shadows and mythic terrors.
    You have been summoned to this sacred sanctuary where the divine ones watch.\n\nBefore
    you stand the images of the Pantheon. Each god offers a unique blessing to forge
    you into a weapon of Rome. Choose with conviction, for the gods are prideful\u2014once
    a path is claimed, they will not hear a plea for change.\n\nStep forth and embrace
    your destiny."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
